+/* [OVMX] vms-095 (component C3 of vms-5f5; docs/design-alpha-per-image-gp.md
+   2.1): output the `.ovmx_gpdisp $15, <proc>' directive that establishes this
+   procedure's per-image module-GP in $15.  The patched alpha-dec-vms gas
+   (binutils port patch 0006-vms-4ed) expands the directive to the
+   ldah $15,0($27) / lda $15,0($15) pair and marks it EVAX_R_OVMX_GPDISP; the
+   OVMX linker patches the signed -K (K = the procedure's PDSC offset within its
+   module linkage section), so at run time $15 = R27(&PDSC) - K = the module
+   linkage-section base.  The register operand is the reserved OVMX module-GP
+   register; the symbol operand is this procedure's PDSC symbol, which is the
